# Accounting Journal Entry
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Accounting — a header-detail document, debit=credit, prepared and posted by different people
# Case 9 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: accounting-chart-of-account.menata, accounting-journal-entry-line.menata, accounting-fiscal-period.menata
#
# Note: "Lines" below is a table-of-rows field — same Language-layer gap as Case 5's
# Unit Conversions (no child-table grammar exists yet). Written provisionally as one
# Fields line, pending a formal grammar addition.

Journal Entry

Fields

- Entry Number : Text
- Entry Date : Date
- Fiscal Period : Fiscal Period
- Memo : Rich Text
- Status : Draft | Posted
- Prepared By : User
- Posted By : User
- Posting Date : Date
- Lines : Table of (Account, Debit Amount, Credit Amount, Line Memo)

Events

When Post

    Posting Date Today

    Posted By Current User

    Sum of Lines Debit Amount must equal sum of Lines Credit Amount

    Fiscal Period must not be Closed

    Posted By must not equal Prepared By

    Status Posted

Constraints

- Entry Number is required.
- Entry Date is required.
- Fiscal Period is required.
- Lines is required.

    Sum of Lines Debit Amount must equal sum of Lines Credit Amount.

    Fiscal Period must not be Closed.

    Posted By must not equal Prepared By.

Permissions

Accountant

- Post

Supervisor

- Post

Views

- Entry Form : Form
- Draft Entries : List
- Posted Entries : List
- Entry Detail : Detail
